    {
      "name": "a person who is not an adult here logs their own reading, can remove it, and is offered nothing for anyone else; an adult logs for anyone but cannot remove a reading someone logged for themselves; a mistyped blood pressure is refused; readings are still there after a reload; earlier readings load on request; unlinking a profile warns before it hides the readings that person logged",
      "members": {
        "sibling": "adult",
        "gran": "child"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "seedRaw",
